<section
  class="consent-settings"
  data-privacy-consent
  data-consent-surface="settings"
  aria-labelledby="consent-settings-heading"
>
  <div class="consent-settings-copy">
    <h3 id="consent-settings-heading">
      <span class="i18n-ja">広告の選択</span>
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">Advertising choice</span>
    </h3>
    <div class="consent-current" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
      <p data-consent-status="undecided">
        <span class="i18n-ja"><strong>未選択。</strong> 広告は読み込まれていません。</span>
        <span class="i18n-en" lang="en"><strong>Not chosen.</strong> Advertising is not loaded.</span>
      </p>
      <p data-consent-status="denied" hidden inert>
        <span class="i18n-ja"><strong>広告OFF。</strong> Google AdSenseは読み込まれません。</span>
        <span class="i18n-en" lang="en"><strong>Advertising off.</strong> Google AdSense is not loaded.</span>
      </p>
      <p data-consent-status="allowed" hidden inert>
        <span class="i18n-ja"><strong>広告を許可。</strong> 本番カスタムドメインで Google AdSense を読み込みます。</span>
        <span class="i18n-en" lang="en"><strong>Advertising allowed.</strong> Google AdSense loads on the production custom domain.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="consent-note">
      <span class="i18n-ja">この選択が制御するのはGoogle AdSenseだけです。元siteの画像やfaviconは広告選択と別に読み込む場合があります。pages.devとローカルpreviewでは、許可しても広告を読み込みません。</span>
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">This choice controls Google AdSense only. Source images and favicons may load independently of the advertising choice. Ads remain disabled on pages.dev and local previews even when allowed.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="consent-actions" role="group" aria-labelledby="consent-actions-label">
    <span id="consent-actions-label" class="visually-hidden">
      <span class="i18n-ja">広告の同意設定</span>
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">Advertising consent setting</span>
    </span>
    <button type="button" data-consent-choice="denied" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="i18n-ja">広告なしで続行</span>
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">Continue without ads</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-consent-choice="allowed" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="i18n-ja">広告を許可</span>
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">Allow advertising</span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <p class="consent-error" data-consent-error role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden inert>
    <span class="i18n-ja">このブラウザへ選択を保存できませんでした。ブラウザの保存設定を確認して、もう一度お試しください。</span>
    <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">The choice could not be saved in this browser. Check browser storage settings and try again.</span>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .consent-settings {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 36%, var(--border));
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-bg) 40%, var(--surface));
  }

  .consent-error {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--danger);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .consent-error[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .consent-settings h3,
  .consent-current p,
  .consent-note {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .consent-settings h3 {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .consent-current {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .consent-current [hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .consent-note {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .consent-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .consent-actions button {
    min-height: 45px;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text-2);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 750;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .consent-actions button[aria-pressed="true"] {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, var(--surface-2));
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .consent-actions button:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    outline: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, white);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .consent-actions button:active {
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .consent-actions button:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .consent-settings {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .consent-actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .consent-actions button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
